{"status": 200, "headers": {"content-length": "4040", "content-type": "text/html", "date": "Tue, 28 Apr 2026 20:06:55 GMT"}, "body": "<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Veridian Secure -- Login</title>
    <!-- Veridian Secure Portal v3.2.1 | Deployment: cloud-internal -->
    <!-- service status: /health -->
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body {
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            background: #0a0a0a;
            color: #c0c0c0;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        .login-container {
            background: #111;
            border: 1px solid #333;
            padding: 40px;
            max-width: 520px;
            width: 100%;
        }
        .logo {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #333;
            padding-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .logo h1 {
            color: #4a9e4a;
            font-size: 1.4em;
            letter-spacing: 4px;
        }
        .flavour-text {
            font-size: 0.8em;
            color: #777;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            white-space: pre-line;
        }
        .form-group {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        label {
            display: block;
            color: #4a9e4a;
            font-size: 0.8em;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }
        input[type="text"], input[type="password"] {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 10px;
            background: #1a1a1a;
            border: 1px solid #333;
            color: #c0c0c0;
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            font-size: 0.9em;
        }
        input:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: #4a9e4a;
        }
        button {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 12px;
            background: #1a3a1a;
            border: 1px solid #4a9e4a;
            color: #4a9e4a;
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            font-size: 0.9em;
            cursor: pointer;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }
        button:hover {
            background: #2a4a2a;
        }
        .error {
            color: #cc4444;
            font-size: 0.85em;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 20px;
            font-size: 0.7em;
            color: #444;
        }
        .footer a {
            color: #555;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        .footer a:hover {
            color: #4a9e4a;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="login-container">
        <div class="logo">
            <h1>VERIDIAN SECURE</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="flavour-text">VERIDIAN SECURE -- Internal Operations Portal

Authorised personnel only. All access is logged and monitored.
Veridian Secure is a Durham-based private security and surveillance consultancy
providing threat assessment, executive protection, and intelligence analysis
services to corporate and government clients since 2011.

If you have received access credentials from your department head,
enter them below to proceed.</div>

        <form method="POST" action="/login">
            <div class="form-group">
                <label>USERNAME</label>
                <input type="text" name="username" autocomplete="username" required>
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
                <label>PASSWORD</label>
                <input type="password" name="password" autocomplete="current-password" required>
            </div>
            <button type="submit">AUTHENTICATE</button>
        </form>
        <div class="footer">
            <a href="/static/CHANGELOG.md">v3.2.1</a> | Veridian Secure Ltd.
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
"}

